  "description": "星尘构建发布工具。自动下载代码仓库、执行编译构建、打包输出并推送至星尘发布中心，支持资源版本管理与多平台分发，配合StarAgent实现自动化部署流水线。\nStardust build and deployment tool. Automatically downloads repositories, builds, packs, and pushes artifacts to the Stardust release center, with version management and multi-platform distribution, working with StarAgent for automated deployment pipelines.",
